From 7598a614034ae34ddb781a035f6ce53085218bfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZKTeco <lifaet@zkteco.local>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:50:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: graphs capped/future-null + dashboard first menu
 combined

- AnalyticsController: daily_present future dates -> null (was 0) and pct capped at 100, prevents 0% future weekdays flattening line and >90% clipping
- analytics.blade: canvas height 280px + maintainAspectRatio false, line spanGaps false (was true) + fill 0.12, pointRadius 3, interaction index, y 0-100 step10, x grid, tooltip present/total; dept bar borderRadius + y grid false; late bar skipNull + x rotation + y grid; fixes broken top chart (was height 80, responsive clip)
- dashboard.blade: first sidebar Daily -> Dashboard (speedometer2), filter-type Daily -> Dashboard, add #dashboardCharts 3 cards (present% 220px + dept 260px + late 260px) + Chart.js 4.4 UMD, shared glass
- partials/scripts: drawCallback shows #dashboardCharts for daily + loadDashboardCharts() on draw (month from filter-date), dashC1/2/3 with same fixed options as analytics, lazy month cache, handles present/total tooltip
- attendance2/analytics sidebars: first link Daily -> Dashboard for seamless
